### CatalogService.read Books
GET http://localhost:4004/brows/Books?
&$select=ID,title,author
&$filter=contains(author,'name')

### AdminService.read Authors
GET http://localhost:4004/admin/Authors?
&$select=ID,name
&$expand=books($select=ID,title)
Authorization: Basics alice;

### CatalogService.submitOrder()
POST http://localhost:4004/brows/submitOrder
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic bob:

{
    "book": 19900521,
    "quantity": 3
}